{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dreadline is a co-op horror fishing game where you embark on dangerous waters to try and catch enough fish to pay off your debts to a shady merchant.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/DifferentFishingTechniques.png?t=1742660441\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different fish require different tools. You\u2019ll use rods, nets, and harpoons to catch increasingly strange creatures lurking beneath the fog-covered waters. The further you venture, the more specialized equipment you'll need to tackle the different fish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/upgradeYourBoat.png?t=1742660441\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to make it back to shore in time before nightfall, you'll need to upgrade your boat if you want to make it out to the farthest reaches. Speed, hull reinforcement and fuel capacity are essential. You may also want to tack on some more... offensive upgrades, for the more dangerous waters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/WatchOutForMonsters.png?t=1742660441\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who knows what swims in the depths below? These waters are dangerous, and there have been unusual creatures sighted around here. Make sure to keep an eye out, and try to keep a low profile. Some monsters are attracted to the light, some sneak up on you\u2014stay alert!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576880?t=1742660441","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576880?t=1742660441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/6b2a08621ad4ae9a7958628782536266c9a03d3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742660441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/6b2a08621ad4ae9a7958628782536266c9a03d3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742660441","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Discord_Capsule_2.png?t=1742660441\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dreadline is a co-op horror fishing game where you embark on dangerous waters to try and catch enough fish to pay off your debts to a shady merchant.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/DifferentFishingTechniques.png?t=1742660441\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different fish require different tools. You\u2019ll use rods, nets, and harpoons to catch increasingly strange creatures lurking beneath the fog-covered waters. The further you venture, the more specialized equipment you'll need to tackle the different fish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/upgradeYourBoat.png?t=1742660441\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to make it back to shore in time before nightfall, you'll need to upgrade your boat if you want to make it out to the farthest reaches. Speed, hull reinforcement and fuel capacity are essential. You may also want to tack on some more... offensive upgrades, for the more dangerous waters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/WatchOutForMonsters.png?t=1742660441\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who knows what swims in the depths below? These waters are dangerous, and there have been unusual creatures sighted around here. Make sure to keep an eye out, and try to keep a low profile. Some monsters are attracted to the light, some sneak up on you\u2014stay alert!</p>","developers":["ManaBrigade"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/2ec8cba4466cdf49137a3d2b9cf3838793ce7caa/header.jpg?t=1742660441","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115434,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115434/movie480.mp4?t=1742508450","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115434/movie_max.mp4?t=1742508450"},"name":"Dreadline Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115434/93b99aec158504957e34752f77fc1cdc1eba8613/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742508450","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115434/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742508450","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115434/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742508450"}}],"name":"Dreadline: Net Quota","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["ManaBrigade"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas l\u00edcitas\nMedo","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol / Taba